<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CRITICAL SYSTEM WARNING</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background-color: #050811;
      color: #00ff66;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .box {
      border: 2px solid #ff3333;
      background: rgba(20, 5, 5, 0.9);
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.5);
      max-width: 400px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #ff3333;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      animation: blink 1s infinite;
    }
    p {
      color: #dddddd;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .highlight {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.15);
      color: #ffcc00;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px dashed #ffcc00;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    @keyframes blink {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.3; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="box">
    <h1>⚠️ SYSTEM HACKED ⚠️</h1>
    <p>Your mobile device has been locked and compromised.</p>
    <div class="highlight">
      Reach out to your boyfriend immediately to unlock your device!
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
